ries  come to his mind and suddenly he sees  isla who is putting stones in her  backpack and goes to the sea to try to  commit suicide  will rescues her and the girl gets upset  bashing was determined to do it will  takes isla to his father's building but  toby tells her that there are several  protocols that she has to go through in  order to accept her  at that very moment the doctor arrives  then isla realizes that he is will's  father  and he interviews her before accepting  her the questions during the interview  are pretty deep and either feels  uncomfortable  since they speak as if nothing about  suicide and loss of people  but she agrees to answer everything  meanwhile will explores the place a  little more and toby shows him his  bedroom his brother is excited because  that night some problems will be solved  and they will have a talk with the  people that's been following their  father's investigation at night dr  harbour is giving a speech to some  people and will joins the group the  doctor explains that all of them are  selected because they understand the  magnitude of his objectives and he  believes that they will be able to  support him during his investigation  then the doctor gets them all relaxed  before showing them a boy that is  connected to his machines who will be  used to show them what is beyond the  door on the other plane of existence  while they plan how to do it the doctor  says he wants to be connected to the  machine others say it's too risky and he  comments that there is another  possibility but they have to get the  body of someone who's already dead  they all comment that it's going to be  difficult to obtain that but isla says  she knows how they follow isla's  indication and arrive at a morgue where  the plan is for toby to distract the  guard while will and isla choose and  steal the body  when they're planning this they also  discuss what could be behind death's  door they choose the body and escape  from the place the plan wa